        {
          "type": "rich_text",
          "id": "a-body",
          "variant": "prose",
          "heading": "How we started",
          "html": "<p><em>Sample text — replace me:</em> Halls close. This diner does not. {{guild_name}} asked once, promised mats, promised tips, and kept both promises. The waitress knows who drinks decaf. The quilt talk happens between the grilled cheese and the check.</p>",
